<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>Read API token</title>
<h1>Read API token created</h1>
<p>Save this secret now. It is shown only in this response. If it is lost, create a replacement in settings.</p>
<p><code id="read-api-token">{{ secret }}</code></p>
<p>It permits only the version 1 site and latest-state reads. A password change or rehash invalidates it; browser logout and idle expiry are independent.</p>
<p><a href="/settings">Return to settings</a></p></html>
